int num[6] = { 2, 4, 12, 5, 45, 5 } ;
int n[ ] = { 2, 4, 12, 5, 45, 5 } ;
float press[ ] = { 12.3, 34.2 -23.4, -11.3 } ;

Note the following points carefully:

(a) Till the array elements are not given any specific values, they are supposed to contain garbage values.

