and its parameters. But don’t get scared of it. Nobody is supposed to remember all the parameters, their meaning and their order. You can always use MSDN (Microsoft Developer Network) help to understand the minute details of each parameter. This help is available as part of VC++ 6.0 product. It is also available on the net at http://www.msdn.microsoft.com/library. Note that CreateWindow( ) merely creates the window in memory. We still are to display it on the screen. This can be done

